%h1 Multi-Step Content Generator
%p
  Type a short idea. The AI turns it into finished content in 6 steps:
    Understand → Outline → Draft → Review → Improve → Final.

= form_with url: generate_path, id: "idea-form" do |form|
  = form.label :idea, "Your idea"
  = form.text_area :idea, value: @idea, rows: 4,
    placeholder: "We launched a new employee attendance feature."
  %p.hint
    Add any facts you know (dates, features, links).
    The AI does not invent facts, it writes [placeholders] instead.
  = form.submit "Generate", id: "generate-button"
  %p#waiting.waiting{ hidden: true } Running the 6 steps... this takes 1-2 minutes. Please wait.

- if @error
  %p.error= @error

- if @results
  %h2 Final content
  .final= markdown(@results[:final])

  %h2 Output of every step
  %details
    %summary Step 1: Brief
    %pre= JSON.pretty_generate(@results[:brief])
  %details
    %summary Step 2: Outline
    %pre= JSON.pretty_generate(@results[:outline])
  %details
    %summary Step 3: Draft
    = markdown(@results[:draft])
  %details
    %summary Step 4: Review (score #{@results[:review]["score"]}/10)
    %pre= JSON.pretty_generate(@results[:review])
  %details
    %summary Step 5: Improved draft
    = markdown(@results[:improved])

:javascript
  // Show a "please wait" message while the 6 steps run.
  document.getElementById("idea-form").addEventListener("submit", function () {
    document.getElementById("generate-button").disabled = true;
    document.getElementById("waiting").hidden = false;
  });
